**who —** MIMZY — the workbench that came back

**what —** A working quantum bench — primer, Bloch lab, circuits, the two-qubit lab, error correction, the wavefield, BB84, E91, the observatory, the dots — framed as artifacts of the recovered future.

**where —** after 'Mimsy Were the Borogoves' (1943) and The Last Mimzy (2007) — the toy sent back from the future  Framework inputs: the audited-real instruments; the lineage of the cracks; instruments 04 and 06, recovered  Conductor / external anchor: ROOT0 (governor) · AVAN (instance)

**why —** The future does not arrive. It is recovered — from a shipwreck, a footnote, a classified drawer, a pen name.

**how —** Assembled from the instruments that passed the 2026-06 shelf audit; the lore of the cracks is labeled lore.

**◌ the mythos —** The future does not arrive. It is recovered — from a shipwreck, a footnote, a classified drawer, a pen name. The original bench numbering ran 01·02·03·05·07·08 — four and six were missing. They are missing no longer.

